---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="shell article-grid">
    <aside class="margin-note"><div class="kicker">what is this thing</div></aside>
    <article>
      <h1>about</h1>
      <p><strong>Daily Side-Channel</strong> is a personal briefing optimized for discovery rather than coverage: underground culture, strange physical artifacts, creative processes worth stealing, mathematical trapdoors, weird history, and collisions between subjects that normally aren't invited to the same table.</p>
      <p>It deliberately skips mandatory beats, manufactured urgency, politics, celebrity news, crypto, and AI-industry churn. Some days there is a signal. Some days there is only a very good hole in the ground.</p>
      <p>The archive is stored as plain Markdown in GitHub. The website is just a reading machine built around it.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
